# multi_asset: pause and resume transitions while sessions are open across assets.
# Verifies creation is blocked while paused, existing sessions still settle/cancel/recover,
# and creation resumes after unpausing.
# Synthetic. Layout: fuzz/README.md (8 bytes per step).
00 00 00 00 00 64 00 00  # create asset 0, dur 50
00 01 01 01 00 64 00 01  # create asset 1, dur 150
00 02 00 01 00 64 00 03  # create asset 2, dur 10
07 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  # pause_creation
07 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  # duplicate pause_creation (rejected)
00 00 00 00 00 10 00 00  # create asset 0 while paused (rejected)
00 01 01 00 00 10 00 00  # create asset 1 while paused (rejected)
01 00 00 20 00 00 00 00  # settle session 0 while paused (succeeds)
02 01 00 00 00 00 00 00  # cancel session 1 while paused (succeeds)
04 01 00 00 00 00 00 00  # advance ledger by 10 (session 2 expires)
03 02 00 00 00 00 00 00  # recover session 2 while paused (succeeds)
07 01 00 00 00 00 00 00  # resume_creation
07 01 00 00 00 00 00 00  # duplicate resume_creation (rejected)
00 02 01 00 00 50 00 00  # create asset 2 after resume (succeeds)
